 r of administrative law\, a former Justice of the California Supreme Court
 \, President of the Carnegie Endowment for International Peace\, and curre
 nt Chief Global Affairs Office of Anthropic to explore how AI is reshaping
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/reimagining-ame
